# Public konto API base — inlined into the client bundle at PRODUCTION build time.
# NOT a secret: this is the public login API host, already visible in the client
# bundle + every network call. Committed so production builds are REAL-mode and
# deploy-proof, independent of the Vercel env-var scope (which kept reverting konto
# to the demo bridge on git-triggered redeploys). A Vercel Production env var of the
# same name OVERRIDES this; blank it there, or revert this file, to fall back to demo.
# Dev/preview builds are unaffected (this file loads only in production mode).
PUBLIC_KONTO_API_BASE=https://liitu.mikrokvalifikatsioon.ee
